================================================================================

--- BrainWeb (REMOVED 2026-08-14) ----------------------------------------------

  Source     https://brainweb.bic.mni.mcgill.ca/brainweb/
             McConnell Brain Imaging Centre, Montreal Neurological Institute,
             McGill University
  Licence    [UNRESOLVED] -- no copyright notice, licence or terms-of-use
             statement was found on the BrainWeb site. Only a citation
             requirement is stated.
  Required citation, as given by the source:
             C.A. Cocosco, V. Kollokian, R.K.-S. Kwan, A.C. Evans,
             "BrainWeb: Online Interface to a 3D MRI Simulated Brain Database",
             NeuroImage, vol. 5, no. 4, part 2/4, S425, 1997.
             plus the site URL above.

  Absence of a licence is not permission. Rather than seek it, the two
