--- scatterBrains (scb16)  --  THE ONLY SHIPPED HEAD ---------------------------

  Source     https://github.com/wumelissa/scatterBrains
  Licence    scatterBrains License Agreement                [VERIFIED]
             Copyright (C) 2023 Melissa M. Wu, Stefan A. Carp
             A BSD-style agreement: "Redistribution and use in source and
             binary forms, with or without modification, are permitted
             provided that the following conditions are met", the conditions
             being retention of the copyright notice. Provided AS IS.
  Required citation, as given by the source:
             Melissa M. Wu, Roarke W. Horstmeyer, Stefan A. Carp,
             "scatterBrains: an open database of human head models and
             companion optode locations for realistic Monte Carlo photon
             simulations", J. Biomed. Opt. 28(10) 100501 (2023).

  This is the one upstream source whose terms clearly permit redistribution of
  derived models, provided this notice travels with them -- which is why it is
  now the only one shipped. The Monte-Carlo reference field (scb16/Cz) is
  derived from this model and carries the same terms.

  One head is shipped, of thirteen scatterBrains heads in the dataset. This
  repository is a demonstration, not an evaluation artefact -- the evaluation
  is in the paper, and the full head set goes to reviewers separately.

--- SHARM (REMOVED 2026-08-13) -------------------------------------------------

  Source     Rashed et al., "SHARM: Segmented Head Anatomical Reference
             Models", arXiv:2309.06677
  Licence    [UNRESOLVED] -- and for a specific reason. The paper distributes
             the dataset through https://figshare.com/s/a4d9ba6f18a6b7f7ba2c ,
             which is a figshare PRIVATE SHARE link, not a published item with
             a DOI and a licence field. The paper calls the data "open-access"
             but states no licence.
  Upstream   SHARM is generated from the IXI MRI dataset via ForkNet+.
             IXI: https://brain-development.org/ixi-dataset/
             "This data is made available under the Creative Commons
             CC BY-SA 3.0 license."                         [VERIFIED]

  Two independent reasons, either sufficient on its own: SHARM states no
  licence, and its upstream carries ShareAlike, which propagates to adaptations.
  The two SHARM-derived heads that this repository originally shipped (sh001,
  sh027) were therefore removed on 2026-08-13, from the working tree AND from
  git history. They can be regenerated from docs/HEAD_MODELS.md by anyone who
  obtains SHARM themselves.

  SHARM remains an input to the TRAINING set described in the paper. Nothing
  here withholds the method; only the derived files are not redistributed.

--- OASIS-3 (not shipped) ------------------------------------------------------

  Under a Data Use Agreement restricting the sharing of derived data. No OASIS
  head, and no OASIS-derived quantity, appears in this repository. The 84
  OASIS heads are the project's true held-out set; obtain access from
  https://www.oasis-brains.org/ and rebuild them with docs/HEAD_MODELS.md.

